to help in the ways they can too.

505
00:24:09,114 --> 00:24:10,282
- Thanks.
- No problem.

506
00:24:10,348 --> 00:24:12,384
Big Bird, can I help you?

507
00:24:12,451 --> 00:24:15,053
- Yes, Mrs. Elmo's mom.
- All right.

508
00:24:15,120 --> 00:24:16,888
- Bye, Big Bird.
- Bye-bye.

509
