- Bye, Big Bird.
- Oh, hi, Mr. Post Malone.

510
00:24:19,524 --> 00:24:22,194
- Hey there, Elmo. Abby, how we doing?
- Hi.

511
00:24:22,260 --> 00:24:25,130
Oh, thank you so much
for coming to Sesame Street

512
00:24:25,197 --> 00:24:27,132
