513
00:24:27,199 --> 00:24:29,000
Absolutely. I'm more than happy to do it.

514
00:24:29,768 --> 00:24:31,002
You know,

515
00:24:31,069 --> 00:24:35,507
Elmo thinks that maybe
a little help is all it takes

516
00:24:35,574 --> 00:24:38,343
to make our street a better place.

